prosdk
Copyright (c) Probot Studio.

prosdk contains code from WPILib and from third-party projects that WPILib distributes. That
code is vendored (copied and mechanically transformed) by tools/upstream/wpilib.py from

  https://github.com/wpilibsuite/allwpilib
  commit b68effca4ddc9742ac208daa7dd1d11816137882 (tools/upstream/wpilib.lock)

Changes to upstream code are the mechanical renames described in design/PORT.md sections 4-6
and the patch files in tools/upstream/patches/. The list of vendored files is
tools/upstream/generated.txt. The license texts are in licenses/:

  licenses/wpilib/LICENSE.md              WPILib license (BSD 3-Clause)
  licenses/wpilib/ThirdPartyNotices.txt   WPILib third-party notices with the full license text
                                          of every component listed below except Catch2
  licenses/Catch2-LICENSE.txt             Boost Software License 1.0
  licenses/eigen/COPYING.*                Eigen's license files as shipped with Eigen (Eigen is built
                                          with EIGEN_MPL2_ONLY, so only MPL 2.0 code is compiled)

